  "title": "Resource-constrained laundry solutions for astronauts | Tide",
  "description": "Tide is partnering with NASA to keep astronauts’ spacesuits clean in the ISS and deep space. Learn more about our new cooperation!",
  "og": {
    "title": "Resource-constrained laundry solutions for astronauts | Tide",
    "description": "Tide is partnering with NASA to keep astronauts’ spacesuits clean in the ISS and deep space. Learn more about our new cooperation!",
